  "lore": "Amazo is a powerful android from DC Comics capable of copying the powers and abilities of other superheroes. Created by Professor Ivo, Amazo can replicate powers such as super strength, speed, flight, and energy projection, making him one of the most dangerous artificial beings in the DC universe."
